<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ελ-</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Corinn.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			1.29
		</span></i>), <u>Helicon</u>, a hill in Boeotia, the seat of the
		Muses, <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
			<u>Op.</u>
			639
		</span></i>, etc.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλῐκωνιάδες</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένοι</span>), αἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwellers on Helicon</i>, i.e.
			<u>Muses</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Pae.Fr.</u>
				16.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				2.34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					658
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3067.10
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Teos</span>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλῐκωνίδες</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νύμφαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1108
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μοῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					791
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.682.13
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Hermione</span>): sg., of a poet's
				<i>reed-pen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.162
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλικωνιάς, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑάκινθος</span>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.62
			</span></i>.</div>
